OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: Contains graphic details of
OL,7,FRebekah Arter's death - and references
OL,8,Fto coercion and sexual abuse
OL,10,FA former Metropolitan Police detective,
OL,11,Finvestigated for sexually exploiting
OL,12,Fvulnerable crime victims it was his job
OL,13,Fto protect, later lied about the death
OL,14,Fof his wife in a Barbados hotel room,
OL,15,FBBC Panorama has learned.
OL,17,FWarren Arter first met his wife Rebekah
OL,18,Fafter she reported domestic abuse to
OL,19,Fthe Met. He then abused her for more
OL,20,Fthan a decade. Her death two years ago
OL,21,Fhas never been properly investigated.
